        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Adoraâ€™s still getting the hang of this whole â€œwantingâ€ thing, Glimmer and Bow put up with a lot, and Catra negotiates gainful employment. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Or: Theyâ€™re intergalactic diplomats. Thereâ€™s an incident. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Or: Five times Adoraâ€™s newfound possessive streak gets the better of her and one time it gets the better of Catra.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
