          <rdf:li>Adora &amp; Bow &amp; Catra &amp; Glimmer (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Bow/Glimmer (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Glimmer (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Bow (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Melog (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>if you don't have canonical aliens homemade is fine</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Future Fic</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Post-Canon</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>5+1 Things</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Post-Season/Series 05</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora gets to have nice things</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>turns out Catra's a nice thing</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>this consistently amazes her</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Fluff and Angst</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>But mostly fluff</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>IN SPACE!</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>somehow this developed a plot</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra has bad dreams</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>they get to cuss</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Friendship</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Jealousy</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>C &amp; A are both possessive little shits</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra just has more practice at it</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>character work disguised as fluff</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Canon Compliant</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>F/F</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>F/M</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>No Archive Warnings Apply</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>they're all learning how to manage their feelings</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>and also be space diplomats</rdf:li>
